==Shinkansen Network==
{{See also|Shinkansen in Okaiken}}
The backbone of the OR network is the [[Shinkansen]] system, which connects the three major islands via undersea tunnels and massive bridges. The three lines converge at [[Toyozawa Station]], located near the geographical center of the archipelago. The OR Group as a whole operates and maintains the Shinkansen Network to allow for better consistency of timetable planning and integrated ticketing.

